    "faq_with_ingredients_Rea9Gk": {
      "type": "faq-with-ingredients",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_content_KaRqNa": {
          "type": "collapsible_content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Clean and natural ingredients - perfect for you",
            "content": "<p>Our supplement is made with only natural, premium ingredients in their high absorbable format. It’s vegan, gluten-free, soy-free, lactose-free, and free from artificial colours and flavours, providing pure nourishment without compromise.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_content_4tFLW7": {
          "type": "collapsible_content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Crafted with care, backed by science",
            "content": "<p>We design every product with female health experts, using research-driven formulation to meet your unique needs. Our approach prioritises safety, effectiveness, and innovation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_content_cUF3dV": {
          "type": "collapsible_content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Quality you can trust",
            "content": "<p>Proudly manufactured in the UK, in a GMP-certified facility, and third-party tested for purity and safety. Every step reflects our commitment to excellence and transparency.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_content_VTaWYf": {
          "type": "collapsible_content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Our formula",
            "content": "<p>Our formulation uses highly bioavailable, pre-activated nutrient forms that your body absorbs easily. Many vitamins and minerals must be converted into their active forms before the body can use them - a process that can be inefficient for many people. By using pre-activated forms, we bypass this step, improve absorption, and ensure more of each nutrient actually reaches where it’s needed.</p><p>This results in:</p><ul><li>better effectiveness, because more active nutrients reach your bloodstream and tissues.</li><li>faster results, as optimally absorbed nutrients begin working sooner.</li><li>fewer side effects, since highly absorbable forms are gentler on the digestive system and ideal for sensitive individuals.</li></ul><p>Everything we include is chosen with intention for the best tolerance, maximum effectiveness, and meaningful support for your body.</p>"
          }
        },
        "ingredient_XY44kA": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "metaobject_type": "plant_extract",
            "metaobject_handle": "lemon_balm_extract",
            "custom_title": "Menstrual pain"
          }
        },
        "ingredient_bCyACM": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "metaobject_type": "minerals_profile",
            "metaobject_handle": "magnesium",
            "custom_title": "Sleep stess and mood"
          }
        },
        "ingredient_tmpWar": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "metaobject_type": "vitamin_profile",
            "metaobject_handle": "vitamin-b2",
            "custom_title": "Energy & performance"
          }
        },
        "ingredient_8prnQ6": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "metaobject_type": "vitamin_profile",
            "metaobject_handle": "vitamin-c",
            "custom_title": "Skin, hair and nails"
          }
        }
      },
